<title>POLAND: Polish zloty fix stronger at 3.54 pct from parity.</title>
<headline>Polish zloty fix stronger at 3.54 pct from parity.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland fixed the zloty at 3.0370 to the dollar, down from 3.0350 yesterday and at 1.7855 against the mark, up from 1.7910, the NBP said.</p>
<p>The central bank fixed the zloty at 3.54 percent from the weighted average dollar and mark parity rates, stronger than Monday's 3.34 percent fixing. -- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
